They were The Bleeding Skull Horde's.","kind":"bad","at":[27,14]},{"turn":197,"player":0,"text":"Our agent was caught talking in The First Hollow. They know whose it was.","kind":"bad","at":[27,14]},{"turn":197,"player":1,"text":"Archer is promoted.","kind":"good","cue":"promote","at":[16,24]},{"turn":197,"player":1,"text":"Archer comes out of the ruin having learned something in there.","kind":"good","at":[16,24],"actor":86},{"turn":197,"player":1,"text":"Highmarch completes Chapel of Mild Optimism.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":197,"player":1,"text":"Something is standing in the ruin, and it was not standing there before.","kind":"bad","at":[30,31],"subject":"raiders-sighted"},{"turn":197,"player":2,"text":"Everyone Has A Price discovered.","kind":"research","cue":"discovery"},{"turn":197,"player":2,"text":"Somebody worked out that a soldier is a person, and that a person who is paid once a season can be paid twice. The second payment is the interesting one, and nobody has yet found the argument against it.","kind":"info"},{"turn":197,"player":2,"text":"Research begins: Asking Around.","kind":"research"},{"turn":197,"player":2,"text":"Grub wades ashore.","kind":"info","at":[23,12]},{"turn":198,"player":0,"text":"Two Orcs comes out of the ruin having learned something in there.","kind":"good","at":[10,38],"actor":411},{"turn":198,"player":0,"text":"Bonechew has fallen into disorder.","kind":"bad"},{"turn":198,"player":0,"text":"Deepcell completes Orc.","kind":"good","cue":"built"},{"turn":198,"player":0,"text":"Archer defeats Mimic-caste after 15 rounds.","kind":"combat","at":[28,15],"actor":159},{"turn":198,"player":2,"text":"Mimic-caste is wiped out.","kind":"bad","at":[28,15]},{"turn":198,"player":2,"text":"The First Hollow is talking of nothing but its grievances, and nobody can say who started it.","kind":"bad","at":[27,14]},{"turn":198,"player":1,"text":"Peasant finishes a road.","kind":"good","at":[49,20]},{"turn":198,"player":1,"text":"Peasant finis